  "policy_quote": "flight can be cancelled if any of the following is true: - The booking was made within the last 24 hrs - The flight is cancelled by airline - It is a **business flight** - The user has travel insurance and the reason for cancellation is covered by insurance. The API does not check that cancellation rules are met, so the agent must make sure the rules apply before calling the API!",

